WEBVTT

00:00:29.715 --> 00:00:33.831
and incredibly delicate
and difficult family circumstances

00:00:33.855 --> 00:00:35.691
would be incredibly taxing.

00:00:37.022 --> 00:00:41.807
And so with this warning in mind,
I entered my residency training,

00:00:41.831 --> 00:00:45.420
expecting it to be an extraordinarily
difficult three years.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:52.724
I was training with 70
some odd fellow recent graduates

00:00:52.748 --> 00:00:57.184
who came to work each day,
almost without exception,

00:00:57.208 --> 00:00:59.796
with a mindset of how we could all
help each other out.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:03.696
I came to work each day feeling
like I was coming to work with friends.